-- Generic module-sheaf basis-map extension, separately audited.
-- The supplied finite basis-cover property and compatible actual local maps
-- determine a global natural linear map. Two finite-cover separation steps
-- prove its equation on every basis element; unique gluing eliminates mere
-- presentations only into a proposition. Selected sections/maps are opaque
-- before the module-map laws. No replacement or truncation-elimination
-- construction is reopened by later declarations.
